<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Encrinus liliiformis Schnakenberg wavelength at 12 nm (Muschelkalk, 240 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Docstring, regime(), and growth_rate() are the onset formula. Lean theorems muschelkalk_wavelength_is_chronoseries_minimum, schnakenberg_trace_negative, and inhibitor_drive_positive_and_equal_diffusion_fails are the integer forms of those claims. They use decide on concrete Nats, not mathlib analysis." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Encrinus liliiformis Schnakenberg wavelength at 12 nm (Muschelkalk, 240 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The Jacobian, onset formula k_c^2 = (D_v f_u + D_u g_v)/(2 D_u D_v), dispersion eigenvalue, and periodic integrator are all in the script and the self-test checks them. The rendered disk uses harmonics of the image fundamental whose physical radius is n_wave times 12 nm. Above threshold the fastest mode shifts; that shift is reported rather than hidden." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Encrinus liliiformis Schnakenberg wavelength at 12 nm (Muschelkalk, 240 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 88/100" ;
