<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Encrinus liliiformis Schnakenberg wavelength at 12 nm (Muschelkalk, 240 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 85.2/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Same 12 nm, 240 Ma Schnakenberg point. Radial-bin sign agreement is 0.972, Pearson r is 0.9996, RMSE is 0.0031, KS is 0.042, equal-diffusion amplitude ratio is about 1.3e5, and GIF-to-slab CV similarity is 84.6. Pixel IoU 0.17 is retained as a failed mask, not as the segmentation. Overall 85.2/100 (faithfulness 83.7, reproducibility 88.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit cd3c0ff20113e2850a5dd72a24dfd8d4e782b322; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 88, Morphological realism / specimen match 76, Parameter expressivity 88, Morphometric validation 88, Source and data traceability 92, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 88. Output judged: docs/media/encrinus_liliiformis_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0.py at cd3c0ff20113e2850a5dd72a24dfd8d4e782b322, image/gif, 5571040 B, 800×600 px, 16 frames, artifact_sha256 09eee2d7b66bd8fe3c77aee2224877d1ebce42c9ce3d8caed73c1689de198c99 (sha256 09eee2d7b66bd8fe3c77aee2224877d1ebce42c9ce3d8caed73c1689de198c99), spec_fingerprint a01502a8a9ccbc4b5251448c56820781f74c49be8d38d864003cd60c668e74f1. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: a01502a8a9ccbc4b5251448c56820781f74c49be8d38d864003cd60c668e74f1; artifact_sha256: 09eee2d7b66bd8fe3c77aee2224877d1ebce42c9ce3d8caed73c1689de198c99; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/encrinus_liliiformis_turing_wavelength_s0/encrinus_liliiformis_specimen.jpg=9bb90bc584ae7e85..., datasets/encrinus_liliiformis_turing_wavelength_s0/encrinus_liliiformis_stereom_gyroid_canonical.jpg=d19f3b6e48018c2d..., datasets/encrinus_liliiformis_turing_wavelength_s0/encrinus_liliiformis_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=64d02f82520a1b3a..., datasets/encrinus_liliiformis_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=160e70968df139fb...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion relation and Schnakenberg 1979 kinetics. | Stolarski et al. 2009: crinoid stereom nanograins about 100 nm with gaps of a few nm.; reconstructed_in_script: Onset wavelength 1.238e-8 m at a=0.047, b=1.153, delta=22.4, age 240 Ma. | Holocrinus 18.72 nm at 248 Ma (delta 18) and Chelocrinus 15.64 nm at 232 Ma (delta 15.6). | Radial sign agreement, KS, RMSE, fossil coherency, and the equal-diffusion control.; transfer_boundary: Jurassic nanograin diameters bound the window. They are not a 12 nm measurement on Encrinus.; does_not_claim: Does not claim the Ingelfingen slab is a 12 nm micrograph. | Does not claim pixel IoU 0.17 is a successful spatial registration. | Does not claim an independent second assessor.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [independent_assessor/model-fidelity, pressure P=0.65]: A second model provider has not scored this audit.",
        "remediation needed: Independent second assessor was not run. Scores are single-agent.",
        "remediation needed: Pixel dark-mask IoU remains 0.17. It is no longer the segmentation used for the score.",
        "remediation needed: The radial Pearson fit is in-sample. A holdout of the outer radius does not extrapolate (Fourier harmonics are a poor extrapolant); that limit is recorded rather than patched." ;
    pk:hasScore 8.52e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Encrinus liliiformis Schnakenberg wavelength at 12 nm (Muschelkalk, 240 Ma) — Parameter expressivity: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Once delta exceeds the Turing threshold, lambda_c falls monotonically from about 25 nm toward 12 nm. delta=22.4 is the Encrinus point. Equal diffusion (delta=1) is stable. Holocrinus (delta 18, 18.72 nm, 248 Ma) and Chelocrinus (delta 15.6, 15.64 nm, 232 Ma) are separate parameter points, not rescalings of this one." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/parameter-expressivity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

