        "does_not_claim: Does not claim the Ingelfingen slab is a 12 nm micrograph.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Holocrinus 18.72 nm at 248 Ma (delta 18) and Chelocrinus 15.64 nm at 232 Ma (delta 15.6).",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Onset wavelength 1.238e-8 m at a=0.047, b=1.153, delta=22.4, age 240 Ma.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Radial sign agreement, KS, RMSE, fossil coherency, and the equal-diffusion control.",
        "reported_in_source: Stolarski et al. 2009: crinoid stereom nanograins about 100 nm with gaps of a few nm.",
        "reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion relation and Schnakenberg 1979 kinetics.",
        "transfer_boundary: Jurassic nanograin diameters bound the window. They are not a 12 nm measurement on Encrinus." ;
